  "_notes": "SG02-EESA (D-034): few-shot generation aimed at the 4 most frequent SG01-most-errors types (330 texts each, class mix = the type's gold mix). Examples: 5 SG01-most-errors texts (EESA dev; dev contamination accepted by Ammar, 2026-11-10) of the request's type and class, drawn per request; all of them if a group has fewer than 5. Sampling, batch and seed as sg01_eesa. 1.6x requests; top up with --margin if a cell falls short after filtering (no duplicates allowed)."
